  27:Cpp_Core/Src/usb_board_link_port.cpp **** /*
  28:Cpp_Core/Src/usb_board_link_port.cpp ****  * PA12 rising-edge handling on CH585 is the RX rearm boundary.  A concurrent
  29:Cpp_Core/Src/usb_board_link_port.cpp ****  * USBHS ISR can delay that edge handler, so bootstrap, CAPS, and IAP retain
  30:Cpp_Core/Src/usb_board_link_port.cpp ****  * the proven 200-us ownership guard.  After CAPS explicitly advertises the
  31:Cpp_Core/Src/usb_board_link_port.cpp ****  * fast-data-plane contract, Application input frames use a fixed 20-us guard;
  32:Cpp_Core/Src/usb_board_link_port.cpp ****  * CH585 still performs its second NSS sample before the DMA direction switch.
ARM GAS  C:\Users\nicx5\AppData\Local\Temp\cc6iWIVC.s 			page 2


