  35:../common/usb_board_link_protocol.h ****  * read through the transaction-correlated USB_CONTROL pull RPC; asynchronous
  36:../common/usb_board_link_protocol.h ****  * absolute credit events are intentionally ignored for this channel because a
  37:../common/usb_board_link_protocol.h ****  * delayed snapshot could re-authorize an already-consumed slot. Other bulk
  38:../common/usb_board_link_protocol.h ****  * channels retain the four-message window.
